OL,3,GNEWSAFestival returns as council issues
OL,4,Awildfire warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-day music festival is set to
OL,7,Freturn to a Derby park, with increased
OL,8,Fmeasures in place to prevent potential
OL,9,Fwildfires.
OL,11,FThe Darley Park Weekender is due to
OL,12,Ftake place from 21 to 23 August with
OL,13,Fboy band JLS, Marti Pellow of Wet Wet
OL,14,FWet and Billy Ocean hitting the stage.
OL,16,FDerby City Council is hosting the event
OL,17,Fagain, despite a significant drop in
OL,18,Fticket sales for the 2025 shows.
OL,19,FFigures provided to the BBC showed just
OL,20,Fover 6,000 tickets were sold for the
OL,21,F2025 event, down from 11,000 in 2024
OL,22,Fand 15,000 in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
