OL,3,GNEWSAFestival returns as council issues
OL,4,Awildfire warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has said there will be a
OL,7,F"low-level" pyrotechnic display and
OL,8,Fdesignated smoking areas due to the dry
OL,9,Fground.
